00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:33.889
Okay, so I turn the page and two things happened,
when a surprisingly calm Toji is standing

00:06:33.889 --> 00:06:38.800
there with a big hole in the side of his body:
Firstly, I finally understood, that I had

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:43.340
been idiot for seeing Toji as some sort of
underdog fighting his way to the top.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:45.379
That's not what makes him so relatable.

00:06:45.379 --> 00:06:51.140
In fact, just like Gojo, he had been born
with one of the strongest powers in the Jujutsu

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.560
world, right from the start.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:57.490
Heavenly restriction, that has turned out
to be an inherited technique in the Zenin

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:02.810
family, is only able to reach it's true potential,
when the amount of cursed energy in the user

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.870
is exactly 0.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:12.439
It made Toji an absolutely superhuman monster,
that could not be detected, but easily overwhelm

00:07:12.439 --> 00:07:17.819
cursed techniques using his ridiculous instincts
and physical strength alone.

00:07:17.819 --> 00:07:24.960
Gojo had to overcome his limits to take this
man down.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:33.189
Toji had always been one of the strongest,
it's just that the Zenin clan defines strength

00:07:33.189 --> 00:07:40.000
in terms of cursed energy, so they were quite
literally blind to his true strength, just

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.460
like I was.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.689
Even though Maki foreshadowed it so well.

00:07:44.689 --> 00:07:49.790
And even more frustratingly, how Toji then
foreshadowed it for Maki in turn later on.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:54.270
And you know what, Maki losing her remaining
cursed energy and essentially becoming the

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:59.901
Kill Bill version of Toji, has been one of
the wildest rides in the story so far, and

00:07:59.901 --> 00:08:02.520
that's saying something.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:07.050
The SECOND thing that happened when Toji died,
was that I realized that his philosophy of

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:12.430
not giving a damn about anything, was nothing
but one big facade.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:17.610
When he asks Gojo, missing half of his body,
to help his son, the last thing he thought

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:22.810
about before dying, Akutami set the stage
to make this character way deeper than I had

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.020
anticipated.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.819
Until now, Toji was cool.

00:08:25.819 --> 00:08:27.430
But now I was really curious.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:40.580
If Toji had loved Megumi after all, how the
hell did he end up like this?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:45.570
Toji is pretty much the personification of
the entire story of jujutsu Kaisen, uniting

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:51.020
the themes of love, strength and the dysfunctional
coldness of the Jujutsu Society.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:54.480
He is the result of the current toxic system.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:59.240
Even though, Akutami never explicitly mentions
anything about his time with the Zenin clan,

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:04.950
given his current state and what we know form
Maki's experience, it doesn't take much imagination

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:13.280
to figure that his childhood must have terribly
sucked.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:23.130
Toji, and later Maki, are basically the badass,
but tragic outcome of a society that denies

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:27.530
love and attention to anyone deemed to be
weak in their eyes.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:32.320
Whenever I see Toji OR Maki act the way that
they do, you just know that the current system

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.190
has to be abolished.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:39.870
Which is ironic, because the next arc will
be about protecting said system.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:44.160
And yet, I strongly believe that it'll the
job of Itadori, Fushiguro and Kugisaki to

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:48.920
build a world in which someone like Maki can
laugh and love and where someone like Toji

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:54.850
never has to become the emotionally crippled
monster he is.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:10:00.760
Completely deprived of any affection, Toji,
even more than Maki, is unable to express

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:07.070
love and care, even though both their needs
as a character is having a real loving family.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:11.520
Instead, they try to fill the hole in their
heart by becoming strong.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.780
They want to be acknowledged by the clan that
treated them as outcasts.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:21.320
Toji not being able to deal with the death
of Megumi's mother, decides to warp his usual

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:27.500
self, as he calls it, his loving self, and
abandons his kid, thinking it will be better

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:30.070
of with the clan that rejected him.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:33.470
I'm sure that plan would have worked out fantastically.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:38.500
In this scene here, we are made to believe
that Toji doesn't even remember his own kid's

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:45.090
name, and yet Megumi, the name he gave his
son, literally means 'blessing'.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:48.890
Even though you and I didn't know it yet,
this right here is a man that struggles to

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:54.350
drown his love and worries for his child,
because he just doesn't know how to deal with

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:55.350
it.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:11:00.770
And realizing that really broke my heart.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:09.580
And it gets even worse when you see that Megumi
has pretty much inherited this trait.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:18.600
Before growing with Yuji and Nobara, Megumi
constantly is supressing his emotions AS WELL

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:24.600
as his powers, believing himself to be weak,
before pulling a sudden domain expansion or

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:32.630
summoning Mahoraga.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:37.950
Despite his fathers love for him, he had to
grow up with no idea of what a family was,

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.060
except for his step sister.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:44.790
with the same sense of isolation and distance
from his family that Toji did, fully lacking

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:50.631
the unconditional love a child needs from
his parents in order to grow up, because Toji

00:11:50.631 --> 00:11:54.870
was never even around for Megumi.

00:11:54.870 --> 00:12:00.430
Just by default he assumes that his father
either didn’t love him, or just starighout

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:07.730
forgot about him.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:13.060
That's why knowing that Toji actually had
cared for him all along, makes his character

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.460
so incredibly bitter sweet.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:21.130
It's only in Toji's very last moment, his
second chance at dying a good death, as Itadori

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:27.230
would say, that he accepts that it was Megumi
who was his true purpose all along.

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:30.410
Not revenge or money or power.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.250
Just family and someone to care for.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.540
The moral message of Jujutsu Kaisen.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:42.050
The only thing Toji regrets as he’s dying
from Gojo's attack all those years ago, is

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.780
not that he wasn’t strong enough.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:49.110
He doesn’t even regret becoming a criminal,
or rebelling against the Jujutsu world.

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:54.190
What he regrets is that he threw away his
family in the process.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:13:02.070
And now he gets to see that his son grew up
just fine, well more or less, and that Megumi

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.160
is stating to walk his own path.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:09.870
And so it hit me, that Toji actually dies
the very way that Yuji wants to, with a smile

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:13.790
on his face, surrounded by the person he loves.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:18.310
Someone who is not only incredibly powerful
and badass for wrecking havoc in the jujutsu

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:26.270
world, but who deep down was a loving father
who never had the chance to express it, until

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.720
he gets one last chance.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:34.430
And that's why a human piece of garbage like
Toji, is one of my favorite characters.

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.240
You should watch Megumi's video here next.

